(7775058, 1292316, 30861, '<td valign="top">
I''m having a hard time seeing this as a "centered composition" with respect to the challenge. For me, the goal was to create an entry where the focus of the image was centered vertically and horizontally. If it were evenly lit the image would pretty much fulfill that criterion, but the heavy vignette pulls the eye to the top third of the image. So there''s that... In all respects, this is a terrific image, beautifully processed. I can''t give you my highest score, but I will lay an 8 on ypu.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time seeing this as a "centered composition" with respect to the challenge. For me, the goal was to create an entry where the focus of the image was centered vertically and horizontally. If it were evenly lit the image would pretty much fulfill that criterion, but the heavy vignette pulls the eye to the top third of the image. So there''s that... In all respects, this is a terrific image, beautifully processed. I can''t give you my highest score, but I will lay an 8 on ypu.', '2025-01-15 08:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
